    "name": {
      "zh": "ZX Spectrum",
      "en": "ZX Spectrum"
    },
    "intro": {
      "zh": "ZX Spectrum 是 1982 年辛克莱推出的英国国民家用电脑，以 Z80 处理器、48KB 内存、彩色图形与橡胶键盘催生了英国卧室编程与独立游戏文化。",
      "en": "The ZX Spectrum, launched by Sinclair in 1982, was Britain's national home computer and the cradle of bedroom coding and the indie games scene."
    },
    "spec_version": "0.2",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "engine_min_version": "0.1.0",
    "precision_level": "L2",
    "era": 1982,
    "manufacturer": "Sinclair Research",
    "category": "personal-computer",
    "description": "ZX Spectrum（1982），英国国民家用电脑：Z80 CPU 3.5MHz、48KB 内存、7 色图形、橡胶键盘 40 键 keyword 体系、磁带存储。",
